The items listed on the receipt include 3x soup at £3.95 each, totaling £11.85;
lunch main course at £6.95; lasagne (V) at £6.95; misc food at £6.95; and 2x chips/onion rings at £1.75 each, totaling £3.50. The subtotal for the food is £29.25. The receipt also includes a previous balance of £29.25, making the total amount due £29.25. The hotel’s address is 69 East High Street, Forfar DD8 2EP, and the telephone number is 01307 463151. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A6.pic5.1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic5.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">Prompt:</span><span id="A6.pic5.1.2.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> How many people are attending this lunch? 
