<span id="A6.pic8.1.2" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:182.8pt;">
<span id="A6.pic8.1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">Prompt:</span><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> What is the duration of this venue sponsorship agreement? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
