<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A6.pic8.1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">Prompt:</span><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Where is Vitucci’s located (complete address)? 
