<span id="A6.pic8.1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">Response:</span><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 1832 East North Avenue, Milwaukee WI 53202 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A6.pic8.1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">Prompt:</span><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> What cigarette brand is mentioned in the agreement for delivery and distribution? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
