<span id="A6.pic8.1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#367DBD;">Prompt:</span><span id="A6.pic8.1.2.7.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> Who has discretion over the distribution of flyers for special events? 
